							style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; color: #404040;">、</span><span
							style="font-size: 7.0pt; font-family: &amp; quot; color: #404040;">&nbsp;</span><span
							style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; color: #404040;">企业的董事、监事、经营管理人员存在《公司法》第一百四十六条所列属的或违反国家其他相关法律法规的情形；</span><span
							style="font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 宋体; color: #404040;"></span>
					</p>
					<p class="MsoNormal"
						style="margin-left: 18.0pt; text-align: left; text-indent: -18.0pt; background: white;"
						align="left">
						<span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; color: #404040;">6</span><span
							style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; color: #404040;">、</span><span
							style="font-size: 7.0pt; font-family: &amp; quot; color: #404040;">&nbsp;</span><span
							style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; color: #404040;">本中心认定的其他情形。</span><span
							style="font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: &amp; quot; color: #404040;"></span>
					</p>
				</td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td style="border: solid windowtext 1.0pt;" width="20%">
					<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; background: white;"
						align="left">
						<span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; color: #404040;">企业形式<span></span></span>
					</p>
				</td>
				<td style="border: solid windowtext 1.0pt;" width="41%">
					<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; background: white;"
						align="left">
						<span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; color: #404040;">境内股份有限公司<span></span></span>
					</p>
				</td>
				<td style="border: solid windowtext 1.0pt;" width="39%">
					<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; background: white;"
						align="left">
						<span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; color: #404040;">境内企业，形式不限<span></span></span>
					</p>
				</td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td style="border: solid windowtext 1.0pt;" width="20%">
					<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; background: white;"
						align="left">
						<span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; color: #404040;">股东或出资人数<span></span></span>
					</p>
				</td>
				<td style="border: solid windowtext 1.0pt;" width="41%">
					<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; background: white;"
						align="left">
						<span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; color: #404040;">股东不超过<span>200</span>人<span></span></span>
					</p>
				</td>
				<td style="border: solid windowtext 1.0pt;" width="39%">
					<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; background: white;"
						align="left">
						<span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; color: #404040;">股份有限公司股东不超过<span>200</span>人，有限责任公司不超过<span>50</span>人，其他组织形式的出资人数须符合国家相关法律法规等规范性文件的规定<span></span></span>
					</p>
				</td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td style="border: solid windowtext 1.0pt;" width="20%">
					<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; background: white;"
						align="left">
						<span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; color: #404040;">投资者<span></span></span>
					</p>
				</td>
				<td style="border: solid windowtext 1.0pt;" width="41%">
					<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; background: white;"
						align="left">
						<span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; color: #404040;">专业投资机构、符合投资者条件的自然人<span></span></span>
					</p>
				</td>
				<td style="border: solid windowtext 1.0pt;" width="39%">
					<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; background: white;"
						align="left">
						<span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; color: #404040;">符合国家法律法规的投资者<span></span></span>
					</p>
				</td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td style="border: solid windowtext 1.0pt;" width="20%">
					<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; background: white;"
						align="left">
						<span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; color: #404040;">信息披露<span></span></span>
					</p>
				</td>
				<td style="border: solid windowtext 1.0pt;" width="41%">
					<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; background: white;"
						align="left">
						<span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; color: #404040;">挂牌前披露公司股份转让说明书、公司章程、法律意见书、审计报告。</span><span
							style="font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: &amp; quot; color: #404040;"></span>
					</p>
					<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; background: white;"
						align="left">
						<span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; color: #404040;">挂牌后必须披露年报、中报，鼓励披露季报。其中，年报须经审计。<span></span></span>
					</p>
				</td>
				<td style="border: solid windowtext 1.0pt;" width="39%">
					<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; background: white;"
						align="left">
						<span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; color: #404040;">挂牌前需进行基本信息披露。</span><span
							style="font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: &amp; quot; color: #404040;"></span>
					</p>
					<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; background: white;"
						align="left">
						<span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; color: #404040;">挂牌后除基本信息披露外，实行自主信息披露，不强制要求披露财务信息。<span></span></span>
					</p>
				</td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td style="border: solid windowtext 1.0pt;" width="20%">
					<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; background: white;"
						align="left">
						<span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; color: #404040;">委托<span>/</span>报价<span></span></span>
					</p>
				</td>
				<td style="border: solid windowtext 1.0pt;" width="41%">
					<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; background: white;"
						align="left">
						<span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; color: #404040;">意向委托、定价委托、成交确认委托<span></span></span>
					</p>
				</td>
				<td style="border: solid windowtext 1.0pt;" width="39%">
					<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; background: white;"
						align="left">
						<span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; color: #404040;">投资者可以通过报价系统网站进行线上自主意向报价信息发布<span></span></span>
					</p>
				</td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td style="border: solid windowtext 1.0pt;" width="20%">
					<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; background: white;"
						align="left">
						<span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; color: #404040;">成交方式<span></span></span>
					</p>
				</td>
				<td style="border: solid windowtext 1.0pt;" width="41%">
					<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; background: white;"
						align="left">
						<span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; color: #404040;">协议转让，投资者可以通过交易系统进行线上交易，交易系统将验证交易双方的股份和资金，并按照相关规则完成清算交收。<span></span></span>
					</p>
				</td>
				<td style="border: solid windowtext 1.0pt;" width="39%">
					<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; background: white;"
						align="left">
						<span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; color: #404040;">通过网上确立意向，网下意向双方经谈判达成协议和完成必要的程序，签署股权转让协议、办理过户登记<span>/</span>记录手续。有限公司的股权转让须在工商行政管理部门进行工商变更记录。<span></span></span>
					</p>
				</td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td style="border: solid windowtext 1.0pt;" width="20%">
					<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; background: white;"
						align="left">
						<span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; color: #404040;">涨跌幅<span></span></span>
					</p>
				</td>
				<td style="border: solid windowtext 1.0pt;" width="41%">
					<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; background: white;"
						align="left">
						<span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; color: #404040;">30%</span>
					</p>
				</td>
				<td style="border: solid windowtext 1.0pt;" width="39%">
					<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; background: white;"
						align="left">
						<span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; color: #404040;">-</span>
					</p>
				</td>
			</tr>
